VALUES ('poco-c71-4gb-64gb-new', 'POCO C71 4GB/64GB - Brand New - 6.88" 120Hz, Android 15, 5000mAh', 'smartphones', 115000, 115000, 95000, 15, 0.19, '/assets/products/poco-c71-4gb-64gb-new.webp', 'The POCO C71 democratizes modern smartphone essentials with Android 15 out of the box. The expansive 6.88-inch HD+ display with 120Hz refresh rate ensures smooth visuals, while the Unisoc T7250 processor and 4GB RAM with memory extension deliver reliable everyday performance. The 13MP AI dual-camera system, 5000mAh battery, and USB Type-C connectivity provide everything needed for first-time smartphone users and budget-conscious buyers. With a clean Android experience and POCO optimized interface, this is pure value without bloat. The side fingerprint sensor and AI face unlock provide convenient security. Brand new, sealed, 1-year POCO warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 95000, '/assets/products/poco-c71-4gb-64gb-new.webp', 105000, 4.3, 1, 'POCO', 1, 1, 'gadgets');

