VALUES ('oraimo-smarttrimmer-2-new', 'Oraimo SmartTrimmer 2 Hair and Beard Clipper - Brand New - LCD Display, Titanium Blades, IPX6', 'personal-care', 35000, 35000, 28000, 15, 0.30, '/assets/products/oraimo-smarttrimmer-2-new.webp', 'The Oraimo SmartTrimmer 2 is a precision grooming tool engineered for the modern gentleman. Featuring self-sharpening titanium-ceramic blades, adjustable length combs (1-10mm), and a powerful yet quiet 7500RPM motor, this trimmer delivers barber-quality results at home. The smart LCD display shows battery percentage and speed setting. The 120-minute cordless runtime from a 2-hour USB-C charge provides weeks of grooming, while the IPX6 washable design ensures hygienic cleaning under running water. Includes 4 guide combs (3mm, 6mm, 9mm, 12mm), cleaning brush, lubricating oil, and USB-C cable. Low-noise design under 55dB. Brand new, sealed with full Oraimo Nigeria warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 28000, '/assets/products/oraimo-smarttrimmer-2-new.webp', 31000, 4.5, 1, 'Oraimo', 1, 1, 'gadgets');

-- itel Hair Clipper Classic 3 (ADD)
