VALUES ('itel-hair-clipper-classic-3-new', 'itel Hair Clipper Classic 3 - Brand New - Titanium Blades, Cordless, USB-C, 4 Guide Combs', 'personal-care', 30000, 30000, 24000, 15, 0.25, '/assets/products/itel-hair-clipper-classic-3-new.webp', 'The itel Hair Clipper Classic 3 is a precision grooming tool engineered for home barbers. Featuring self-sharpening titanium-ceramic blades, adjustable taper lever, and 4 guide combs (3-12mm), this clipper handles everything from fades to full head shaves. The powerful 6500RPM motor delivers consistent cutting power without snagging, while the 90-minute cordless runtime from a 2.5-hour USB-C charge provides multiple grooming sessions. The low-noise operation under 60dB ensures comfortable use. Ergonomic grip with anti-slip texture and easy-clean detachable blade head make maintenance effortless. Includes guide combs, cleaning brush, lubricating oil, and USB-C cable. Brand new, sealed with full itel Nigeria warranty.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 24000, '/assets/products/itel-hair-clipper-classic-3-new.webp', 27000, 4.4, 0, 'itel', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

